497
00:47:57.175 --> 00:47:59.744
No, I didn't.

498
00:47:59.777 --> 00:48:03.414
It's a real story. It's very interesting.

499
00:48:03.448 --> 00:48:05.450
PIERRE: You look like you've been around.

500
00:48:07.785 --> 00:48:10.321
You look like you've got class.

501
00:48:14.492 --> 00:48:17.428
